d help a lot if you left a review - reportedly it increases performance during the next fest. I also will be streaming every day!For content updates, check the blog!https://colossalcitadels.com/posts/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:01:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1818118366182931","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"update","title":"Dec 6 Update","summary":"- can select color for you faction- working on story mode (no spoilers)- fix being able to interact with world when loading- add hints about development milestones (not the Colossal Citadels milestones, but Empire development in the game...)- pressing esc will cancel targetting for all targeting modes now- hovering workers will now also display their production and efficiency- improved some tooltips- can now right click portraits and do usual functions- can now unassign workers from right click ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-08T16:08:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366182931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1807332909674400","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"update","title":"Aug 10 update","summary":"This update brings a number of important bugfixes and requested usability features- Option to disable edge panning- Panning speed options- Can use left mouse button to pan the world- Fixed the issue with activating spells with spacebar when not intended- Updated Chinese translation- Added WIP Japanese translation- Added WIP Swedish translation- Added WIP Ukrainian translation- Added WIP Russian translation- Fixed annoying issue with workers returning to original when you try to drag them- Fixed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-10T17:43:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909674400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806698490744680","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"update","title":"Update - Aug 2","summary":"This small update brings some fixes and a small but very important feature. Changelog:- Creature \"Story\" tab was improved with more descriptions. Some monsters now have extensive descriptions.- Spell targeting type and range is now shown in spell tooltip- Fixed link to creatures and resources in tooltips displaying nothing instead of the item- Improved tutorial flow (fixed some parallel tutorial tracks starting at the same time)- Buffed \"Heroism\" belief (now it accounts non-producing workers in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-02T10:30:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490744680","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806698490632567","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update (July 30)","summary":"This small update addresses some issues and even adds some new content (4 spells)- Some event choice texts were bigger than their buttons- Fixed tooltip issues- Fir's On Consume now gives exp instead of something useless- Crystals can now be mined 5 times instead of 2- All metals can be mined for a bit more- All creature sources can be mined less times- Fixed issues with adding exp on productions- All production and exploration now gives a little bit of exp as intended- Resources list (top left ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-30T00:55:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490632567","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806064758717157","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 250727 - Fixes","summary":"New update is live! It mostly addresses bugs, but there are some UX improvements:- Fixed issues with settings/unlockables don't save if the game crashed- Fixed issue where tutorials were displayed again or when tutorials were disabled- Fixed issue where borders weren't updated if a production change affects them (e.g. with repositioned creatures)- Fixed issue with wrong engineering production counts being limited- If you can't place movement order due to no orders, creatures will still be reposi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-27T20:53:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758717157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806064758623588","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"announcement","title":"A Guide on Advanced Concepts #1","summary":"Recently I released a new guide on advanced concepts that you might have skipped or that are not explained in in-game tutorials yet00:24 Enchanting Characteristics and Spells03:20 Passives and Upgrading03:56 Deck of Understandings05:05 Redraw05:28 Upkeep06:47 Autocast08:45 Damage Estimations09:36 Skill Costs09:57 Movement Predictions and Strategic Mode","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-24T22:53:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758623588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806064758600877","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"announcement","title":"Colossal Citadels: Quickstart Guide / Tutorial","summary":"This tutorial might help you with learning basic concepts of the game. It covers:00:00 Intro00:18 What is it?01:17 Faction Selection02:00 Objectives02:50 UI Rundown05:00 Movement07:52 Productions12:35 Understandings (tech)14:30 Tooltips15:09 Building Houses19:58 Creature Stats22:00 Battles24:00 Weapons25:40 Elemental Gems & Abilities28:15 Fortification Building","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-24T06:48:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758600877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1854570-1806064758600865","game_id":"steam-1854570","kind":"update","title":"July Content Update & Public Demo!","summary":"This is the most important update on Colossal Citadels so far! The demo is out, and you are able to try the game yourself! It is still might be in a rough state, but I think it’s good enough for now. Don’t hesitate to leave any (constructive and non-constructive) feedback in our Discord. Check out the full post for lots of more notes.Let's get to gameplay updates!Archive: Discoverable ResourcesThis is a golden gem of a feature that I came up with a couple of months ago. It both simplifies the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-24T06:36:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758600865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1854570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1854570":"2026-